Error [jet.UnknownFunction]: `I8` is a number type, not a function
  --> tests/ui/number_type_call_fixed_width_teaches_braces.jet:5:11
    |
  5 |     print(I8(n))
    |           ^^
 Why: Jet builds a value of a number type with braces; parentheses call a function
 Fix: Write `I8{n}`
